# --- SOURCE-MATERIAL PROTECTION ---------------------------------------------
# The official book is potentially restricted material. This repository may be
# PUBLIC, so the book, its extracted pages/text, and anything derived verbatim
# from it must never be committed. Remove the "content/book/" line below ONLY
# after the repository has been made private and the owner has decided to
# version the book-derived content pack.
/source/
/private/
/content/book/
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
*.pptx
*.epub
*.zip
